canonical Huffman and exact vector dictionaries. See the accompanying
compression-provenance.json for the source revision and hash.
The optional scale cache uses a separately supplied MxWave native consumer;
that consumer is not included in this package.

The separate mxfp4_codec.py, mxfp4_runtime.py and mxfp4_backend.py adapt the
Apache-2.0 MxWave scale palette, native interface and model integration,
Copyright MxWave contributors. This standalone MXFP4 plugin has its own
bundled native source under integrations/vllm/native/mxfp4 in the source
repository. It adds the ZipServ namespace, explicit on/off controls, generic
palette support, fallback and ownership checks, and a shared-memory reuse
barrier. See mxfp4-provenance.json for exact source identities.

